WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.033 --> 00:00:10.966
- We're finally in Cyllage City!
- Yay, we made it!

2
00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:13.966
- Pika!
- There it is, Pikachu!

3
00:00:14.033 --> 00:00:15.299
Pikachu!

4
00:00:15.366 --> 00:00:19.833
Can't wait to go and challenge Grant, so we can beat the Cyllage City Gym!

5
00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:23.033
- Pikachu!
- Of course Ash is sure that he'll win.

6
00:00:24.433 --> 00:00:27.933
A long journey and lots of training have brought Ash

7
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.133
and the rest of our heroes to his second Gym badge challenge

8
00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:35.600
in Cyllage City, but will all the training be enough?

9
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.833
♪ I want to be the very best ♪

10
00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:43.400
♪ Like no one ever was ♪

11
00:00:43.466 --> 00:00:46.066
♪ To catch them is my real test ♪

12
00:00:46.133 --> 00:00:49.233
♪ To train them is my cause ♪

13
00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.300
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all It's you and me ♪

14
00:00:52.366 --> 00:00:55.500
♪ Pokémon! I know it's my destiny ♪

15
00:00:55.566 --> 00:00:58.933
♪ Pokémon! Yeah, you're my best friend ♪

16
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:01.666
♪ In a world we must defend ♪

17
00:01:01.733 --> 00:01:03.933
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all ♪

18
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:07.033
♪ Got to catch them all! Pokémon! ♪

19
00:01:16.966 --> 00:01:20.100
- Okay, you guys! Let's step on it!
- Pika!

20
00:01:20.166 --> 00:01:24.233
Huh? Ash, where are you going? The Gym isn't that way!

21
00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:25.966
- It isn't?
- Ah!

22
00:01:26.033 --> 00:01:29.300
It looks like it's way up there on that mountain!

23
00:01:40.733 --> 00:01:42.666
Huh?

24
00:01:42.733 --> 00:01:46.000
- Whoa. Wow!
- Pika?

25
00:01:47.699 --> 00:01:50.399
Wow! This is the Cyllage Gym!

26
00:01:50.466 --> 00:01:52.766
- I think.
- This is a Gym?

27
00:01:52.833 --> 00:01:55.733
- Pika!
- Look at the pretty colors!

28
00:01:55.800 --> 00:01:58.100
Whoa! Grant, it's Ash!

29
00:01:59.366 --> 00:02:02.966
I'm here to challenge you to a Gym battle! Are you ready?

30
00:02:03.033 --> 00:02:08.299
Sure. No problem! I've been waiting for you! Climb on up!

31
00:02:08.366 --> 00:02:10.933
- Uh, climb what?
- Pika?

32
00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:14.299
This wall, of course! The battlefield's up at the top!

33
00:02:14.366 --> 00:02:16.033
Huh?

34
00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:18.799
- No way!
- Yes way!

35
00:02:18.866 --> 00:02:22.533
You see, my Cyllage Gym specializes in Rock-type Pokémon.

36
00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:24.700
I feel all challengers should experience

37
00:02:24.766 --> 00:02:27.233
my great love of rocks, so I designed the Gym

38
00:02:27.299 --> 00:02:30.666
to accomplish that by allowing you to climb up on your own power!

39
00:02:30.733 --> 00:02:32.866
- Huh?
- You don't mean all of us, do you?

40
00:02:32.933 --> 00:02:36.966
No. Not to worry! We've got an elevator over there as well!

41
00:02:37.033 --> 00:02:41.366
The choice is yours! Now, just because you don't scale the wall,

42
00:02:41.433 --> 00:02:43.700
doesn't mean I won't accept your challenge!

43
00:02:43.766 --> 00:02:48.466
- What are you going to do, Ash?
- Climb it, of course!

44
00:02:48.533 --> 00:02:50.200
Ready to go, Pikachu?

45
00:02:50.266 --> 00:02:52.700
Pika!

46
00:02:55.266 --> 00:02:57.200
Oh!

47
00:02:59.866 --> 00:03:04.333
Ash, I like your spirit! I'll wait for you at the top!

48
00:03:05.533 --> 00:03:07.033
- Huh?
- Pika! Pika!

49
00:03:07.100 --> 00:03:09.466
Let's go.

50
00:03:09.533 --> 00:03:12.533
- Ha!
- Wait! Bonnie!

51
00:03:12.600 --> 00:03:15.066
- We're going to take the elevator.
- Hm!

52
00:03:29.566 --> 00:03:32.500
-Pika! Pikachu!

53
00:03:42.399 --> 00:03:47.333
-Pika! Pika. Pika.

54
00:03:52.399 --> 00:03:56.066
Ah! Hey there, Grant. I made it!

55
00:03:57.333 --> 00:03:59.333
Well done, Ash.

56
00:04:01.866 --> 00:04:05.566
So what were you thinking about when you were climbing?

57
00:04:05.633 --> 00:04:10.666
Huh? Well, I wasn't thinking about anything!

58
00:04:10.733 --> 00:04:13.866
That's perfect. So what were you looking at?

59
00:04:13.933 --> 00:04:17.500
Huh? Hmm.

60
00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:21.666
- Straight up! Where I was going!
- Excellent.

61
00:04:21.733 --> 00:04:24.266
That means you achieved a state of enlightenment.

62
00:04:24.333 --> 00:04:28.266
Your mind was crystal clear, unclouded.

63
00:04:28.333 --> 00:04:30.800
Now that you've successfully conquered the wall,

64
00:04:30.866 --> 00:04:33.733
the next wall you're going to need to conquer is me

65
00:04:33.800 --> 00:04:37.166
and that's what you came here for, challenger!

66
00:04:37.233 --> 00:04:39.266
- Right!
- Pika! Pikachu!

67
00:04:39.333 --> 00:04:42.566
A question, why do you have challengers climb the wall?

68
00:04:42.633 --> 00:04:45.200
So that inner peace can be achieved.

69
00:04:45.266 --> 00:04:48.200
- Inner peace?
- What's that mean?

70
00:04:48.266 --> 00:04:53.800
Scaling the wall, it's the best way I know to achieve a state of enlightenment.

71
00:04:53.866 --> 00:04:56.700
When I do that, I forget about everything else

72
00:04:56.766 --> 00:05:00.266
and the only thing I concentrate on is reaching the top.

73
00:05:00.333 --> 00:05:02.366
That is my one and only goal.

74
00:05:02.433 --> 00:05:05.766
The only thing I want is to arrive at my destination.

75
00:05:05.833 --> 00:05:10.266
As long as there is a wall for me to climb, I will rise to the challenge!

76
00:05:10.333 --> 00:05:13.266
I want challengers to achieve the same state of enlightenment

77
00:05:13.333 --> 00:05:14.833
when they climb up here to me.

78
00:05:14.900 --> 00:05:17.333
-Pika!

79
00:05:22.566 --> 00:05:27.266
Now, the battle between Grant, the Cyllage City Gym Leader, and Ash,

80
00:05:27.333 --> 00:05:30.466
the challenger from Pallet Town, is about to begin!

81
00:05:30.533 --> 00:05:33.233
The Gym Leader will have the use of only two Pokémon,

82
00:05:33.300 --> 00:05:36.099
while the challenger will have the use of all the Pokémon

83
00:05:36.166 --> 00:05:38.900
that he currently has in his possession.

84
00:05:38.966 --> 00:05:40.400
I can use all of them?

85
00:05:40.466 --> 00:05:42.766
That's how the Cyllage Gym operates.

86
00:05:42.833 --> 00:05:46.400
I want to see everything that Trainers and their Pokémon can do.

87
00:05:46.466 --> 00:05:49.599
Oh, got it! Right now I've got three Pokémon!

88
00:05:49.666 --> 00:05:53.133
We'll work together to do our best and then I'll win that Gym badge!

89
00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:57.900
Only the challenger will be allowed to substitute Pokémon during the battle.

90
00:05:57.966 --> 00:06:00.700
So, if you please, bring out your Pokémon!

91
00:06:00.766 --> 00:06:02.933
I've really been looking forward to your challenge,

92
00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:06.366
since I first saw you battle back at the Battle Chateau.

93
00:06:06.433 --> 00:06:10.166
Now, let's see which Pokémon you plan to use to scale the wall

94
00:06:10.233 --> 00:06:12.099
and that wall is me!

95
00:06:12.166 --> 00:06:14.466
Onix, let's go!

96
00:06:19.633 --> 00:06:23.299
So he's going to use Onix first. In that case, I'll do this!

97
00:06:23.366 --> 00:06:25.599
Froakie, I choose you!

98
00:06:28.833 --> 00:06:31.700
- Froakie!
- Hey, there's Froakie!

99
00:06:31.766 --> 00:06:37.066
Water types have an advantage over Rock types. Ash has a sound strategy!

100
00:06:37.133 --> 00:06:40.633
Serena, is something wrong? You look worried.

101
00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:42.700
Huh?

102
00:06:42.766 --> 00:06:46.433
Bonnie's right. You do look worried. Are you nervous?

103
00:06:46.500 --> 00:06:49.400
Me, nervous? Not at all!

104
00:06:49.466 --> 00:06:52.666
That's weird. Ash is the one who's battling, not you.

105
00:06:52.733 --> 00:06:56.900
Yeah, I know. I didn't understand back at the Santalune Gym,

106
00:06:56.966 --> 00:07:01.466
but now I know how hard it really is to earn a Gym badge.

107
00:07:01.533 --> 00:07:04.233
Ever since Ash saw Grant at the Battle Chateau,

108
00:07:04.299 --> 00:07:07.766
he's been doing nothing but preparing to challenge the Cyllage Gym

109
00:07:07.833 --> 00:07:09.500
and win a badge!

110
00:07:09.566 --> 00:07:12.566
We've all seen how hard Ash has been working.

111
00:07:12.633 --> 00:07:15.233
A victory here would mean the world to him!

112
00:07:15.299 --> 00:07:17.799
And that's why I'm feeling so nervous.

113
00:07:17.866 --> 00:07:20.799
I think we've all been training really hard together.

114
00:07:20.866 --> 00:07:24.299
You're right. I just hope all that training pays off for him.

115
00:07:24.366 --> 00:07:25.700
Huh?

116
00:07:25.766 --> 00:07:28.000
You're rooting for Ash too, Dedenne?

117
00:07:28.066 --> 00:07:29.033
Na-na-na-na.

118
00:07:29.099 --> 00:07:31.533
Huh?

119
00:07:31.599 --> 00:07:34.000
All right. Battle begin!

120
00:07:38.099 --> 00:07:40.299
Okay! Froakie, Water Pulse!

121
00:07:40.366 --> 00:07:42.966
Froakie!

122
00:07:43.033 --> 00:07:48.000
Flash Cannon, go!

123
00:07:49.299 --> 00:07:52.900
- Ah!
- Fro!

124
00:07:52.966 --> 00:07:55.666
- Kie!
- Froakie, are you all right?

125
00:07:55.733 --> 00:07:58.266
- Kie!
- Awesome! Let's go!

126
00:07:58.333 --> 00:08:02.333
Rock Polish!

127
00:08:02.400 --> 00:08:04.333
Onix has increased its speed.

128
00:08:06.133 --> 00:08:08.599
I can see what your strategy is, Ash.

129
00:08:08.666 --> 00:08:11.666
Clearly, attacking Onix's large body is your goal.

130
00:08:11.733 --> 00:08:14.033
But can you deal with its speed?

131
00:08:14.099 --> 00:08:17.700
Now, go after Froakie!

132
00:08:17.766 --> 00:08:20.900
Froakie, stay calm! Use Double Team!

133
00:08:20.966 --> 00:08:24.633
Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro!

134
00:08:24.700 --> 00:08:27.966
Huh?

135
00:08:28.033 --> 00:08:30.200
A speedy Double Team, indeed,

136
00:08:30.266 --> 00:08:33.966
but it isn't going to help you one bit against our next move!

137
00:08:34.033 --> 00:08:35.066
Here it comes.

138
00:08:35.133 --> 00:08:39.233
Now it's time to experience the true power of Rock types!

139
00:08:39.299 --> 00:08:42.233
Use Rock Tomb!

140
00:08:42.299 --> 00:08:43.299
Oh, Ash!

141
00:08:43.366 --> 00:08:45.666
I guess we'll see if all that training pays off!

142
00:08:45.733 --> 00:08:47.566
You can do it, Froakie!

143
00:08:47.633 --> 00:08:49.966
Froakie, watch carefully, then jump!

144
00:08:52.500 --> 00:08:55.166
Fro! Fro!

145
00:08:55.233 --> 00:08:57.233
That should end your Double Team.

146
00:08:57.300 --> 00:08:59.900
Now, let's see if you can escape from our Rock Tomb!

147
00:08:59.966 --> 00:09:03.333
Now, Froakie, show them what all that training was for!

148
00:09:03.400 --> 00:09:06.266
Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro!

149
00:09:06.333 --> 00:09:07.699
- Fro!
- Huh?

150
00:09:07.766 --> 00:09:09.766
Keep on jumping! Higher!

151
00:09:14.333 --> 00:09:16.866
-How is it possible?

152
00:09:16.933 --> 00:09:19.600
We saw that Rock Tomb at the Battle Chateau

153
00:09:19.666 --> 00:09:22.800
and I knew we'd have to beat it for me to earn a badge!

154
00:09:22.866 --> 00:09:26.366
So we did some special training to counteract that move!

155
00:09:26.433 --> 00:09:28.366
I'm beyond impressed!

156
00:09:28.433 --> 00:09:31.100
It's called the Froakie Rock Tomb Climb!

157
00:09:31.166 --> 00:09:35.333
Amazing! The Froakie Rock Tomb Climb!

158
00:09:35.400 --> 00:09:38.333
That should give Ash lots of confidence!

159
00:09:38.400 --> 00:09:40.333
Follow it up with Water Pulse!

160
00:09:40.400 --> 00:09:43.800
Froakie!

161
00:09:46.366 --> 00:09:49.133
Onix, Iron Tail!

162
00:09:49.199 --> 00:09:53.233
Dodge it, quick!

163
00:09:53.300 --> 00:09:57.033
- Fro!
- Okay, now climb up on Onix!

164
00:09:57.100 --> 00:09:59.900
- Kie! Kie!
- Huh?

165
00:09:59.966 --> 00:10:04.633
Onix, shake Froakie off!

166
00:10:04.699 --> 00:10:07.633
- Froakie, way to go!
- Yeah, hang on tight!

167
00:10:07.699 --> 00:10:09.566
Now finish it! Water Pulse!

168
00:10:09.633 --> 00:10:12.900
-Froakie!

169
00:10:19.433 --> 00:10:23.600
Onix is unable to battle. Froakie wins!

170
00:10:23.666 --> 00:10:27.166
All right! The Froakie Rock Tomb Climb rocked it hard!

171
00:10:27.233 --> 00:10:28.600
Pikachu!

172
00:10:28.666 --> 00:10:30.699
Yes! The training paid off!

173
00:10:30.766 --> 00:10:32.666
You were so great, Froakie!

174
00:10:32.733 --> 00:10:36.600
Using Water Pulse from a super-close range, it sure worked well!

175
00:10:36.666 --> 00:10:40.766
Thanks. Great job, Onix. Please return!

176
00:10:40.833 --> 00:10:45.533
You are quite a surprise, Ash. It's exactly what Viola warned me about.

177
00:10:45.600 --> 00:10:49.100
She advised me not to underestimate you and she was quite correct.

178
00:10:49.166 --> 00:10:51.633
The best defense is a good offense!

179
00:10:51.699 --> 00:10:53.600
- That's the way I battle!
- Pika!

180
00:10:53.666 --> 00:10:56.233
Ash, you sure showed them how cool you are!

181
00:10:56.300 --> 00:10:59.600
That's true, but there's still one wall left to climb.

182
00:10:59.666 --> 00:11:03.400
Ash still has one more Pokémon to beat to earn the badge.

183
00:11:03.466 --> 00:11:07.566
Time for my second Pokémon! Tyrunt, let's go!

184
00:11:10.533 --> 00:11:13.966
Tyrunt!

185
00:11:14.033 --> 00:11:16.500
Who's that Pokémon?

186
00:11:21.033 --> 00:11:23.033
It's Tyrunt!

187
00:11:32.533 --> 00:11:34.466
Who's that Pokémon?

188
00:11:36.699 --> 00:11:39.300
Tyrunt, the Royal Heir Pokémon.

189
00:11:39.366 --> 00:11:43.100
Tyrunt's jaws are so big and powerful it can crunch up a car.

190
00:11:43.166 --> 00:11:47.199
If it doesn't like something, it responds with a wild tantrum.

191
00:11:49.300 --> 00:11:53.733
Tyrunt! We have to watch out for that big mouth and those sharp teeth!

192
00:11:53.800 --> 00:11:56.733
Ash should remember that Tyrunt is both a Rock-type

193
00:11:56.800 --> 00:11:58.433
and a Dragon-type Pokémon.

194
00:11:58.500 --> 00:12:01.699
- Dragon type, too?
- It sounds pretty strong to me.

195
00:12:02.933 --> 00:12:05.800
You're scared? Guess you think it's strong, too.

196
00:12:05.866 --> 00:12:08.533
Does the challenger wish to make a substitution now?

197
00:12:08.600 --> 00:12:11.533
No, thanks. I'm going to stick with Froakie, okay?

198
00:12:11.600 --> 00:12:12.600
Kie!

199
00:12:12.666 --> 00:12:14.533
All right, battle begin!

200
00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:18.500
Let's give it everything we've got! Double Team!

201
00:12:18.566 --> 00:12:23.266
Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro!

202
00:12:23.333 --> 00:12:26.733
-Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro!

203
00:12:26.800 --> 00:12:28.366
Tyrunt, Rock Tomb!

204
00:12:31.666 --> 00:12:34.033
- Kie?
- It can use Rock Tomb, too!

205
00:12:38.099 --> 00:12:40.566
Froakie! You and Ash can do it!

206
00:12:40.633 --> 00:12:42.800
The rocks are moving a lot faster!

207
00:12:44.766 --> 00:12:48.400
- Fro! Fro!
- All right, Froakie, Rock Tomb Climb!

208
00:12:48.466 --> 00:12:51.733
Awesome! Rock Tomb Climb and Double Team!

209
00:12:51.800 --> 00:12:53.633
What a fascinating strategy!

210
00:12:53.699 --> 00:12:55.866
Here we go. Use Bubble!

211
00:12:55.933 --> 00:13:00.433
- Kie! Fro!
- Huh!

212
00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:03.033
We'll be able to get all the way up to the top!

213
00:13:03.099 --> 00:13:05.666
- I wouldn't be overly confident.
- Huh?

214
00:13:05.733 --> 00:13:07.166
Now, Tyrunt, jump!

215
00:13:07.233 --> 00:13:10.233
-Whoa.

216
00:13:10.300 --> 00:13:12.199
- Pika!
- Wow, what a jump!

217
00:13:12.266 --> 00:13:14.199
Tyrunt! Draco Meteor!

218
00:13:14.266 --> 00:13:17.933
Tyrunt!

219
00:13:21.166 --> 00:13:24.099
Fro! Fro! Froakie!

220
00:13:27.566 --> 00:13:31.466
- Froakie, no!
- Fro!

221
00:13:31.533 --> 00:13:34.666
Froakie is unable to battle! Tyrunt wins!

222
00:13:36.466 --> 00:13:38.400
- Ah!
- Pika! Pika!

223
00:13:38.466 --> 00:13:41.900
- Oh, no.
- Tyrunt can use Draco Meteor!

224
00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:44.966
Okay, Froakie, return!

225
00:13:46.166 --> 00:13:48.466
- That was an awesome job.
- Pika! Pika!

226
00:13:48.533 --> 00:13:51.000
So, Ash, how do you like my Tyrunt?

227
00:13:51.066 --> 00:13:53.599
I'm especially proud of Tyrunt's strong legs

228
00:13:53.666 --> 00:13:56.800
and its Rock Tomb is the absolute best of the best!

229
00:13:56.866 --> 00:13:59.466
And its Draco Meteor, just how will you climb that wall?

230
00:13:59.533 --> 00:14:02.266
- You know what I think?

231
00:14:02.333 --> 00:14:05.033
The stronger the opponent, the more fun the battle!

232
00:14:05.099 --> 00:14:08.533
I'll deal with any wall you put up for me to climb!

233
00:14:08.599 --> 00:14:11.599
All right, Fletchling, I choose you!

234
00:14:13.333 --> 00:14:15.633
- Fletch!
- A Flying type, eh?

235
00:14:15.699 --> 00:14:19.433
- Fletchling, Razor Wind!
- Fletchling! Fletch!

236
00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:21.933
Use Crunch!

237
00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:27.900
Tyrunt ate the move?

238
00:14:27.966 --> 00:14:30.433
Tyrunt's mouth and teeth are very strong!

239
00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:34.733
- All right, Fletchling, use Double Team!
- Fletchling, Fletchling!

240
00:14:34.800 --> 00:14:37.266
Fling! Fling! Fling! Fling!

241
00:14:39.300 --> 00:14:42.733
It's all or nothing now! Steel Wing, let's go!

242
00:14:42.800 --> 00:14:45.966
- Fly straight in!
- Fletchling!

243
00:14:46.033 --> 00:14:49.500
- Dragon Tail, up!
- Another jump!

244
00:14:49.566 --> 00:14:52.699
Tyrunt's jumping ability is simply incredible!

245
00:14:52.766 --> 00:14:55.233
It totally counters any aerial advantage!

246
00:14:59.766 --> 00:15:03.066
Fletchling!

247
00:15:03.133 --> 00:15:04.533
-Fletch!

248
00:15:04.599 --> 00:15:06.300
- Oh!
- Ling!

249
00:15:07.599 --> 00:15:09.266
Fling! Fling!

250
00:15:09.333 --> 00:15:12.633
Fletchling is unable to battle! Tyrunt wins!

251
00:15:12.699 --> 00:15:15.000
Tyr!

252
00:15:15.066 --> 00:15:17.000
Fletchling, return!

253
00:15:18.433 --> 00:15:20.900
- You were great out there.
- Pika! Pika?

254
00:15:20.966 --> 00:15:23.666
- All right, buddy, it's up to you now!
- Pika!

255
00:15:23.733 --> 00:15:25.500
- You can do it!
- Pikachu!

256
00:15:28.633 --> 00:15:31.166
So it seems we have arrived at our final battle.

257
00:15:31.233 --> 00:15:34.733
I know what all of Tyrunt's moves are. All I've got to do is win!

258
00:15:34.800 --> 00:15:38.900
Your spirit is strong, although Rock Tomb Climb is quite creative.

259
00:15:38.966 --> 00:15:43.666
It won't work against Draco Meteor. Also, Pikachu is an Electric type,

260
00:15:43.733 --> 00:15:46.199
while Tyrunt is a Rock and Dragon type.

261
00:15:46.266 --> 00:15:48.699
Tyrunt clearly has the advantage.

262
00:15:48.766 --> 00:15:50.699
Okay, bring it on!

263
00:15:50.766 --> 00:15:54.433
- Pikachu, Quick Attack!
- Pikachu! Pik! Pik!

264
00:15:54.500 --> 00:15:57.433
Tyrunt, Crunch!

265
00:15:58.500 --> 00:16:01.666
- Jump, Pikachu!
- Pika! Chu!

266
00:16:01.733 --> 00:16:04.900
Draco Meteor!

267
00:16:04.966 --> 00:16:09.599
- Iron Tail, go!
- Chu!

268
00:16:14.866 --> 00:16:17.800
- Look out!
- Pikachu's going to get hit!

269
00:16:17.866 --> 00:16:20.900
You think so? Pikachu, jump as high as you can!

270
00:16:20.966 --> 00:16:23.766
Now, go into Draco Meteor Climb!

271
00:16:23.833 --> 00:16:25.166
Pik! Pik! Pik!

272
00:16:25.233 --> 00:16:26.933
Looks like Rock Tomb Climb!

273
00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:29.599
But they turned it into Draco Meteor Climb!

274
00:16:29.666 --> 00:16:32.666
No matter what happens, you can never count Ash and Pikachu out!

275
00:16:32.733 --> 00:16:35.166
Look at that! Tyrunt, Dragon Tail!

276
00:16:36.933 --> 00:16:40.233
-Keep using Iron Tail!

277
00:16:40.300 --> 00:16:43.233
Pika!

278
00:16:44.433 --> 00:16:47.566
- Pik!
- Hmm.

279
00:16:50.800 --> 00:16:53.266
Excellent! Quite well-executed!

280
00:16:53.333 --> 00:16:56.566
We keep on getting stronger even while we're battling!

281
00:16:56.633 --> 00:17:01.400
And an exciting battle it is. To show my respect for your passion,

282
00:17:01.466 --> 00:17:04.033
I'm going to wrap this up with my favorite move!

283
00:17:04.099 --> 00:17:06.599
- Time for Rock Tomb!
- Well, I'm ready for it!

284
00:17:09.599 --> 00:17:12.300
All right, deflect them with Iron Tail!

285
00:17:12.366 --> 00:17:16.666
Pikachu!

286
00:17:16.733 --> 00:17:19.666
Pik! Pik! Pik! Pik! Pika!

287
00:17:22.366 --> 00:17:24.800
-Tyrunt!

288
00:17:24.866 --> 00:17:26.566
- What a mouthful!
- Ha!

289
00:17:26.633 --> 00:17:29.899
Now Tyrunt can't use Crunch, Pikachu can get in close!

290
00:17:29.966 --> 00:17:32.733
Now I'll wrap this up with my favorite move!

291
00:17:32.800 --> 00:17:34.800
Pikachu, use Thunderbolt!

292
00:17:34.866 --> 00:17:40.100
Pikachu!

293
00:17:43.766 --> 00:17:46.866
Tyrunt is unable to battle! Pikachu wins,

294
00:17:46.933 --> 00:17:50.066
which means the match goes to the challenger Ash!

295
00:17:50.133 --> 00:17:53.800
You were so awesome! Pikachu, we won!

296
00:17:53.866 --> 00:17:56.166
Pika... Pi...

297
00:17:59.399 --> 00:18:00.899
Pika...

298
00:18:00.966 --> 00:18:03.500
- They won!
- Hooray!

299
00:18:03.566 --> 00:18:06.899
That Ash never ceases to amaze me!

300
00:18:06.966 --> 00:18:08.633
Woo!

301
00:18:08.700 --> 00:18:12.533
That certainly turned into a heated and fearsome battle, didn't it?

302
00:18:12.600 --> 00:18:15.899
- Thank you so very much.
- Tyrunt.

303
00:18:15.966 --> 00:18:19.466
-Your Rock Tomb Climb really surprised me.

304
00:18:19.533 --> 00:18:22.833
But the biggest surprise of all was having Pikachu use Thunderbolt,

305
00:18:22.899 --> 00:18:27.433
which shouldn't have been that effective on Tyrunt, a Rock and Dragon type!

306
00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:28.899
Everyone was awesome!

307
00:18:28.966 --> 00:18:31.266
- Pika!
- Froakie!

308
00:18:31.333 --> 00:18:37.633
Thanks to Froakie, Fletchling and Pikachu! This is a victory for all three of you!

309
00:18:37.700 --> 00:18:41.800
Wonderful! By working together, you all managed to scale the wall

310
00:18:41.866 --> 00:18:44.633
that is known as the Cyllage City Gym battle!

311
00:18:46.033 --> 00:18:49.866
As a symbol of that, I present you with the Cliff Badge!

312
00:18:49.933 --> 00:18:53.200
- Pikachu!
- Ah! Thank you so much, Grant!

313
00:18:53.266 --> 00:18:57.366
We did it, Pikachu! All that hard work paid off!

314
00:18:57.433 --> 00:18:59.899
- Pikachu!
- Froakie.

315
00:18:59.966 --> 00:19:01.433
Fletchling! Fletch!

316
00:19:01.500 --> 00:19:06.933
- All right! I won the Cliff Badge!
- Pik! Pikachu!

317
00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:15.166
- Congratulations, Ash!
- That battle was so cool!

318
00:19:15.233 --> 00:19:16.800
I've never seen a battle of yours

319
00:19:16.866 --> 00:19:19.733
when I wasn't completely amazed and impressed by you!

320
00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:21.666
Thanks a lot, you guys!

321
00:19:24.300 --> 00:19:27.966
Tell me, Ash, have you already decided which Gym you'll challenge

322
00:19:28.033 --> 00:19:29.700
for your third Kalos Gym badge?

323
00:19:29.766 --> 00:19:32.700
Nope! Guess I'd better start thinking about that.

324
00:19:32.766 --> 00:19:36.800
I've got an idea! I know the perfect place we should go next!

325
00:19:36.866 --> 00:19:40.366
The Shalour City Gym! There's The Tower of Mastery nearby

326
00:19:40.433 --> 00:19:42.733
and I've always wanted to go see it!

327
00:19:42.800 --> 00:19:46.033
Yes, Shalour City. Good choice. It's quite nice.

328
00:19:46.100 --> 00:19:48.566
Shalour City. Sounds good to me!

329
00:19:48.633 --> 00:19:51.166
I think you'll have quite a different battle experience

330
00:19:51.233 --> 00:19:54.000
at the Shalour Gym than your typical battle.

331
00:19:54.066 --> 00:19:56.800
What kind of different experience is that?

332
00:19:56.866 --> 00:20:00.000
You'll find out when you get there, but I can guarantee you

333
00:20:00.066 --> 00:20:02.933
another challenging and fierce wall for you to climb!

334
00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:05.100
-Pika!

335
00:20:05.166 --> 00:20:09.166
Great! Then I'm going to Shalour City for my next Gym badge!

336
00:20:09.233 --> 00:20:11.399
- And that's that!
- More adventures!

337
00:20:11.466 --> 00:20:15.266
This should be fun! I'm just wondering what kind of Gym it is.

338
00:20:15.333 --> 00:20:18.466
One more thing. Let's have a rematch at the Battle Chateau!

339
00:20:18.533 --> 00:20:19.633
You bet!

340
00:20:19.700 --> 00:20:23.033
Ash, if you want to have a battle with Grant at the Battle Chateau,

341
00:20:23.100 --> 00:20:25.899
don't you need to have the noble title of Grand Duke?

342
00:20:25.966 --> 00:20:29.100
Yeah. You're right. I can do that!

343
00:20:29.166 --> 00:20:31.866
It's all part of becoming a Pokémon Master!

344
00:20:31.933 --> 00:20:33.433
Pika! Pika!

345
00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:37.000
Following a tough battle with Grant at the Cyllage City Gym,

346
00:20:37.066 --> 00:20:40.733
Ash has earned his second Kalos Gym badge, the Cliff Badge!

347
00:20:40.800 --> 00:20:43.733
Now, our heroes set their sights on Shalour City,

348
00:20:43.800 --> 00:20:46.266
as the journey continues!
